<section class="section-one-column home-section home-section--violet">
  <div class="section-inner-container">

    <h2 class="reveal">Questions Businesses Often Ask</h2>

    <h3 class="reveal">Do you take small website jobs?</h3>

    <p class="reveal">
      Yes. You do not need to hire me for a complete website. I can help
      with individual repairs, updates, design changes, and other focused
      improvements.
    </p>

    <h3 class="reveal">Can you work on my existing website?</h3>

    <p class="reveal">
      In many cases, yes. Send me the website address and explain what you
      want changed. I’ll review it and tell you whether I can help.
    </p>

    <h3 class="reveal">Do you build completely new websites?</h3>

    <p class="reveal">
      Yes. I build professional websites for contractors, local service
      businesses, creative companies, authors, artists, and other organizations.
      New projects are scoped individually and quoted based on what you need.
    </p>

    <h3 class="reveal">Do you have experience with contractor websites?</h3>

    <p class="reveal">
      Yes. My ongoing work with West Stamford Fence includes website
      improvements, service content, project presentation, mobile usability,
      contact paths, and local SEO fundamentals.
    </p>

    <h3 class="reveal">Can you improve service pages and project galleries?</h3>

    <p class="reveal">
      Yes. I can organize service information, improve project-photo
      presentation, clarify service areas, and make it easier for customers
      to understand your capabilities.
    </p>

    <h3 class="reveal">Can you improve mobile usability and contact options?</h3>

    <p class="reveal">
      Yes. I can improve mobile layouts, calls-to-action, phone links, forms,
      and other contact paths so the website is easier to use on smaller screens.
    </p>

    <h3 class="reveal">Can you help with local SEO?</h3>

    <p class="reveal">
      Yes. I can improve on-page content, website structure, service and
      location pages, structured data, and other local SEO fundamentals.
      I do not guarantee specific rankings or lead results.
    </p>

    <h3 class="reveal">Can you build creative or interactive website features?</h3>

    <p class="reveal">
      Yes. I can create custom illustration, graphics, animation, characters,
      AI-powered features, and unusual interactive experiences when a project
      calls for something beyond a standard business website.
    </p>

    <h3 class="reveal">Will I work directly with you?</h3>

    <p class="reveal">
      Yes. Mantis Digital Media is my personal business. You communicate
      directly with me throughout the project.
    </p>

    <h3 class="reveal">Where are you located?</h3>

    <p class="reveal">
      I’m located in Shelton, Connecticut. I work with local businesses
      throughout Connecticut and can also complete projects remotely.
    </p>

  </div>
</section>



